  day: 5
  text: "You\u2019ve managed well these past days. I just hope the higher ups also
    see that. B3\u2026 that mineshaft. Nearly all of the other workers got hurt by
    that shaft but me? Well\u2026 Cecilia was my darling. We had worked in this hellhole
    for nearly our whole lives and when I lost her. Well, all the colour had disappeared
    from the world. Thank you for keeping me out of that shareholder-forsaken place."
